<h1><hr class="Journal2">A DAY OF AIR & SPACE WONDER - Thursday, October 28, 2004<hr class="Journal2"></h1>
<p>
<a href="index.php?action=Pics&name=Daily/20041028/DSCN0923.jpg"><img src="Pics/Daily/20041028/Small/DSCN0923.jpg"></a>
