<h1><hr class="Journal2">ROAD TRIP TO NORTH CAROLINA - Saturday, October 30, 2004<hr class="Journal2"></h1>
<p>
<a href="index.php?action=Pics&name=Daily/20041030/DSCN0007.jpg&nocomments=1"><img src="Pics/Daily/20041030/Small/DSCN0007.jpg"></a>
<a href="index.php?action=Pics&name=Daily/20041030/DSCN0019.jpg&nocomments=1"><img src="Pics/Daily/20041030/Small/DSCN0019.jpg"></a>
